module mistake_fnmutwrite .
rem expect: E-EFFECT-PURITY

rem ko: ✘ `fn` 이 `mut` 로 받은 호출자의 줄에 쓴다 /// en: ✘ a `fn` writes into the caller's slice received as `mut`
fn clear input xs mut slice u8 . output void .
do
  var i u64 0 .
  while lt i (len xs) do
    set (idx xs i) 0 .
    set i (add i 1) .
  end
end
